  "sources": [
    {
      "id": "canon",
      "title": "BTTF Part II (1989), theatrical cut",
      "kind": "canon_statement",
      "text": "Marty, Doc and Jennifer travel 1985->2015. Old Biff steals the DeLorean, gives his younger self the Gray's Sports Almanac, returns. The timeline changes around them: 1985 becomes alt-1985 (Biff's wealth, George dead, Lorraine married to Biff). Marty/Doc return to this alt-1985, then go back to November 12 1955 to steal the almanac back and burn it; timeline begins restoring."
    },
    {
      "id": "allocation",
      "title": "Fixture allocations",
      "kind": "test_fixture",
      "text": "Revisions: rA (original history through 2015), rB (almanac-given, alt-history), rC (almanac burned, restoring toward rA). Story order follows the film's view order. Costs of the P2 reading (Marty's 1955 presence during rA and rB simultaneously, Old Biff's return leg) are logged in OPEN_ISSUES.md per the adversarial pass."
    }
  ],
